WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.769
Tom ran up to the palace roof.

2
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.902
Roar! Swoosh!

3
00:00:08.903 --> 00:00:16.582
He could hear the dragon coming closer.

4
00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.507
Tom stared up at the dragon.

5
00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:22.670
"Whoa," he cried.

6
00:00:22.671 --> 00:00:25.593
The dragon was huge and green.

7
00:00:25.594 --> 00:00:31.893
Flames shot from its mouth.

8
00:00:31.894 --> 00:00:38.992
A peddler was throwing pots at the dragon.

9
00:00:38.993 --> 00:00:42.914
A farmer dropped his milk cart and ran away.

10
00:00:42.915 --> 00:00:47.955
Sizzle! Flags and bushes burned.

11
00:00:47.956 --> 00:00:53.823
The dragon roared loudly and came closer.

12
00:00:53.824 --> 00:01:00.885
It stopped and held its belly and roared again.

13
00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:04.842
"Now!" Dirk yelled to the knights and servants.

14
00:01:04.843 --> 00:01:07.582
"Attack that dragon!"

15
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:11.008
The knights threw their swords.

16
00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:14.706
The servants threw their boulders.

17
00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:17.854
Other men shot arrows.

18
00:01:17.855 --> 00:01:24.224
Boom! Bam! The dragon swatted everything away.

19
00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:27.473
Hot flames shot from its mouth.

20
00:01:27.474 --> 00:01:32.188
Soon all the weapons were gone.

21
00:01:32.189 --> 00:01:39.252
All the servants and knights were running away.

22
00:01:39.253 --> 00:01:41.969
Dirk glared at Tom.

23
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:44.823
"I told you to stay downstairs!

24
00:01:44.824 --> 00:01:48.603
Your magic will never work!"

25
00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:53.297
Dirk ran away too.

26
00:01:53.298 --> 00:01:57.399
Cat slipped out of Tom's pocket.

27
00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:05.511
The dragon breathed again—and Cat's tail caught fire!

28
00:02:05.512 --> 00:02:09.355
"There!" Tom pointed to a bucket of water.

29
00:02:09.356 --> 00:02:14.482
Cat quickly dunked her tail.

30
00:02:14.483 --> 00:02:18.290
"That's a huge dragon!" said Cat.

31
00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:22.862
She jumped back into Tom's pocket.

32
00:02:22.863 --> 00:02:25.967
"Dirk's right!" Tom moaned.

33
00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:33.797
"My magic will never work!"

